== Aftermath ==
=== Drops ===
{{CreatureDrops|stars=0}}

=== Forsaken power ===
Mounting Yagluth’s trophy upon his respective stone will allow the player to claim his Forsaken Power. This ability will grant the player and nearby allies the following effects for 300 seconds:

* Damage modifier: [[Resistance|Resistant]] vs Lightning
* Farming: +25
* Damage dealt increase: Blunt, Slash, Pierce, Chop, Pickaxe, Fire, Frost, Lightning, Poison, Spirit: +10%

See [[Forsaken_power#Yagluth_Power|Yagluth's power]] for more details.

=== Events ===
Defeating Yagluth affects the following [[events]] for that world:

* Disables: "The horde is attacking."
* Enables "What's up Gjall?!"
* Enables "They sought you out."

=== Creature spawning ===
Defeating Yagluth unlocks [[Fuling]]s to spawn at night in the [[Meadows]], [[Black Forest]], and [[Mountain]]. They can only have 0 stars.

=== Traders ===
Defeating Yagluth unlocks [[Egg]]s for sale from [[Haldor]] for 1500 [[Coins]]. It also unlocks the [[Grasslands Herbalist Harvest]] from [[The Bog Witch]] for 160 [[Coins]].

